    {FuluIndexedAttestation_h.IndexedAttestation_bx_rt(_) == (h, (O.BSome{LV.pjb_IndexedAttestation_bx(o), O.BNone{}}, d_IndexedAttestation_bx(hl, O.BSome{LV.pjb_IndexedAttestation_bx(o), O.BNone{}}))) : B.Buf & (O.Boxed<FuluIndexedAttestation_d.IndexedAttestation> & D.Digest)}
  {==}
